  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mekong River Commission (MRC) Juli 2012-Dec 2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mekong River Commission (MRC) July 2012-Dec 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Mekongflodens flodkommission (MRC) utg&#xe5;r under perioden     juli 2012 tom 2015, i enlighet med MRCs Strategiska Plan.Sve har      samarbetat m MRC under m&#xe5;nga &#xe5;r och speciellt fokuserat p&#xe5; att ge     st&#xf6;d till milj&#xf6;progr., fiskeprogr. och Basin Development Plan samt    genom institutionellt st&#xf6;d till sekretariatet. Detta avtal innefattar &#xe4;ven tv&#xe5; nya st&#xf6;d till klimatanpassningsprogr. och flood mitigation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Mekong River Commission (MRC) is agreed for the       period July 2012 through 2015, according to the MRCs Strategic Plan.  Swe has collaborated w MRC for many years and especially focused on   providing support to Env, Fisheries and Basin Development Plan        Programmes and through institutional support. This agreement also     includes two new Programmes for CC Adaptation and Flood Mitigation.</narrative>
  </description>
